menu "Car data capture"
    config CAR_RPM_CAPTURE_HZ
        int "RPM logging poll rate (Hz)"
        range 10 200
        default 100
        help
            Poll the latest DShot feedback at this rate. Log only new samples,
            retaining the original reply timestamp. Intermediate replies can
            be missed; this does not capture every DShot frame. RC telemetry
            remains at 10 Hz.

    config CAR_WHEEL_DIAMETER_MM
        int "Wheel diameter (mm)"
        range 1 1000
        default 68
        help
            Rolling wheel diameter used for the RPM-based ground-speed estimate.

    config CAR_MOTOR_REVOLUTIONS_PER_WHEEL_X100
        int "Motor revolutions per wheel revolution (x100)"
        range 1 100000
        default 177
        help
            Gear reduction multiplied by 100. A value of 177 means 1.77 motor
            revolutions per wheel revolution; 100 means direct drive.
endmenu
